            </span>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100">Too many categories</h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
            Starting with 30+ budget categories guarantees failure. Start with 5-8: Housing, Food, Transport, Utilities, Savings, Entertainment. Add more only when you actually need them.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Mistake 2: All-or-nothing thinking -->
        <div class="mistake-card rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900 shadow-[8px_8px_16px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08),-4px_-4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] dark:shadow-[8px_8px_18px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5),10px_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.12),-3px_-3px_6px_rgba(255,255,255,0.08)]">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
